WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:04.655
Unit twenty-four. Heart Attack and Stroke Signs!

2
00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:10.282
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.332 --> 00:00:13.383
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:18.127
Today we learn about Heart Attack and Stroke Signs. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.001 --> 00:00:23.067
Heart attack. Say it with me. Heart attack!

6
00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:29.817
Stroke. Say it with me. Stroke!

7
00:00:33.338 --> 00:00:37.438
Chest pain. Say it with me. Chest pain!

8
00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:44.195
FAST. Say it with me. FAST!

9
00:00:47.688 --> 00:00:51.005
Face. Say it with me. Face!

10
00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:58.343
Arms. Say it with me. Arms!

11
00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:05.679
Speech. Say it with me. Speech!

12
00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:12.568
Time. Say it with me. Time!

13
00:01:16.112 --> 00:01:30.125
Heart attack signs include chest pain and shortness of breath. For stroke, remember FAST: Face drooping, Arms weak, Speech difficulty, Time to call emergency services. Quick action saves lives.

14
00:01:30.175 --> 00:01:33.517
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:34.228 --> 00:01:39.785
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.835 --> 00:01:41.218
Chest pain!

17
00:01:42.456 --> 00:01:47.892
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.942 --> 00:01:49.092
Speech!

19
00:01:50.088 --> 00:01:56.258
Did you know? In a stroke, every minute counts — fast treatment can reduce brain damage!

20
00:01:56.308 --> 00:01:58.660
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.806 --> 00:02:07.150
Think and answer. What does FAST stand for?

22
00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.350
Great answer!

23
00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:15.422
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:15.472 --> 00:02:18.366
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

